`extract-person-contacts` migration creates the `person` docs. Because we keep the full `parent` field for places and persons, if you just update the first layer you get inconsistent data.

E.g. you get docs like this : 

```
{
   _id: clinic1
   contact: { _id: contact1, ... } // 2.x contact
   parent: {
      _id: healthcenter1
      contact: {name : Alice, phone: 1234} // 0.x contact
   }
}
```

while the healthcenter1 doc is this : 

```
{
   _id: healthcenter1
   contact: { _id: contact2, name : Alice, phone: 1234 } // 2.x contact
}
```

We might as well get clean data once and for all! Make the migration edit at infinite depth of parents.

